(Database design is the process of creating a detailed data model for a database. It involves organizing data) Tj
T* (according to a database model, often a relational model, to achieve high performance, efficiency, data) Tj
T* (integrity, and scalability. Effective database design is crucial for the success of any data-driven application or) Tj
T* (system, ensuring data consistency, reducing redundancy, and facilitating easy data retrieval and) Tj
T* (manipulation.) Tj
