(Database design is the art and science of structuring data to meet specific business needs and application) Tj
T* (requirements.) Tj
T* (- Its primary goals include ensuring data integrity, minimizing data redundancy, optimizing query performance,) Tj
T* (and providing flexibility for future modifications.) Tj
T* (- A well-designed database forms the backbone of robust and scalable applications.) Tj
T* (- Key concepts involve understanding entities, attributes, relationships, and the principles of data modeling.) Tj
ET
