(Boyce-Codd Normal Form \(BCNF\)) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0 g
170.0787401574803255 751.1813385826771992 Td
(Every determinant is a candidate key. Stricter than 3NF.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0 g
283.4645669291338663 751.1813385826771992 Td
(Handles some specific anomalies not caught by 3NF, especially with overlapping candidate keys.) Tj
ET
