56.6929133858267775 399.6852755905511003 Td
(Database design is a methodical process essential for creating efficient, reliable, and scalable data systems.) Tj
T* (It progresses through requirements gathering, conceptual, logical, and physical design phases. Key principles) Tj
T* (include data modeling using ERDs to represent entities and relationships, and normalization to reduce) Tj
T* (redundancy and enhance data integrity. Advanced considerations like indexing, denormalization, and security) Tj
T* (are vital for optimizing performance and ensuring data protection. A well-designed database is fundamental to) Tj
T* (the success and maintainability of any application relying on data.) Tj
ET
